// Eraser type: Sequence diagram
// Paste into app.eraser.io → Diagram as Code → Sequence

colorMode pastel
styleMode shadow
typeface clean
autoNumber on

Match source [icon: database, color: orange] > Ingest [icon: fastapi, color: blue]: events in
activate Ingest
Ingest > Interpret [icon: fastapi, color: blue]: normalized
activate Interpret
Interpret > Explain [icon: azure-ai-studio, color: purple]: match agents and Foundry narration
activate Explain
Explain > Render [icon: fastapi, color: blue]: narration
deactivate Explain
activate Render
Render > Gateway [icon: fastapi, color: green]: overlay
deactivate Render
activate Gateway
Gateway > Browser [icon: monitor, color: green]: SSE / WebSocket
deactivate Gateway
deactivate Interpret
deactivate Ingest
